    "description": {
      "value": "This cloak appears to be woven from a thousand living leaves, hungry for flesh and eager to defend the cloak's wearer. The leaves lash out at your attacker, rising up to reveal snapping jaws made of wicked thorns. The triggering creature must attempt a DC 17 Reflex saving throw. {'Success': ['The creature is unaffected.'], 'Failure': ['The creature takes 1d4 piercing damage.'], 'Critical Failure': ['The creature takes 2d4 piercing damage and 1 bleed damage.']} The save DC is 30, and the cloak can be activated once per round. The leaves deal 2d6 piercing damage to a creature on a failed save, or 4d6 piercing damage and 3 bleed damage on a critical failure."
